    }
]

request.description:
Send message to multiple person.

You can also set custom `delay` between each message by adding the delay (in milliseconds) to the `delay` properties. Default value is `1000` if you don't provide any delay or you provide an invalid delay.

Example:

``` javascript
[
  {
    "receiver": "628231xxxxx",
    // 1000ms / 1 seconds delay before it try to send the message since we don't provide any delay
    "message": {
      "text": "hi! how are you?"
    }
  },
  {
    "receiver": "628950xxxxx",
    "delay": 60000, // 1 minutes delay before it try to send the message
    "message": {
      "text": "i'm fine, thank you!"
    }
  }
]

```

### Typing indicator (per recipient)

Add `typing` to any entry to show "typing…" before the message is delivered.

| Value | What happens |
| --- | --- |
| `true` | Derive a duration from the length of the message text |
| `1500` | Show it for 1500 ms |
| `{ "duration": 1500 }` | Same thing |
| `false`, `0`, `""` | No indicator — the default when omitted |

The indicator is always cleared before the message is sent, and a socket that
refuses to show it will not stop the message going out.

